, substituting these into our chain rule formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂\\theta} & =(3 r \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 8 r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)})(- r \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)})+(2 r \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 3 r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)})(r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)}) \\\\  & =(- 3 r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 8 r^{2} \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)})+(2 r^{2} \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 3 r^{2} \\cos^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)}) \\\\  & =- 3 r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 6 r^{2} \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 3 r^{2} \\cos^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["178906e3-57c0-56b7-986d-f2501a1f24d0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "ab089900-ab5c-58c7-b4fc-284ea3c05606" :answer/id #uuid "ab089900-ab5c-58c7-b4fc-284ea3c05606" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3 r^{3} \\sin^{3}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 4 r^{3} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 6 r^{3} \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 2 r^{3} \\cos^{3}{\\left(\\theta \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9c1045dc-ae7b-53d6-a201-09fd8a333326" :answer/id #uuid "9c1045dc-ae7b-53d6-a201-09fd8a333326" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{- 3 r^{3} \\sin^{3}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 4 r^{3} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 6 r^{3} \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 2 r^{3} \\cos^{3}{\\left(\\theta \\right)}}{r}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9306357a-dd3a-55a8-86f4-13d69d861185" :answer/id #uuid "9306357a-dd3a-55a8-86f4-13d69d861185" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 3 r^{3} \\sin^{3}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 4 r^{3} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\cos{